{% doc %}
  @prompt
    1. Typography & Header Configuration (Updated)
    Font Family: Barlow (Apply to the entire section, including titles, buttons, and card text).
    
    Alignment: Both the Main Title and Subtitle must be centered by default.
    
    Dynamic Customization (Shopify Theme Editor / Metafields):
    
    Please make the Text Content, Font Size, and Positioning/Alignment for both the Title and Subtitle fully adjustable from the backend customization panel so we can tweak them later without changing the code.
    
    Default Header Content & Setup:
    
    Main Title (Centered by default): Unlock Extra Savings
    
    Subtitle (Centered by default): Mix & Match Any Eligible Products and Save More.
    
    📐 2. Layout & Responsive Design
    Desktop View:
    Layout: The 3 promo code boxes should be displayed horizontally in a single row (3-column layout) below the subtitle.
    
    Sizing: Ensure all 3 boxes have identical min-height and widths so they align perfectly, regardless of text length.
    
    Mobile View (max-width: 768px):
    Preferred Solution: Please turn the 3 code boxes into a horizontal swipeable row (Carousel/Slider), showing 1.2 or 1.5 boxes on the screen at a time, allowing users to swipe through them.
    
    Alternative Solution: If a slider is too complex here, we can stack them vertically into a single column, but a horizontal swipeable row is highly preferred.
    
    📋 3. Code Boxes & Content (Barlow Font)
    Tier 1 Code Box:
    
    Code: BUY2SAVE20 (With a "Copy Code" action button)
    
    Description: Buy Any 2 Eligible Products Save $20
    
    Tier 2 Code Box:
    
    Code: BUY3SAVE30 (With a "Copy Code" action button)
    
    Description: Buy Any 3 Eligible Products Save $30
    
    Tier 3 Code Box:
    
    Code: BUY4SAVE40 (With a "Copy Code" action button)
    
    Description: Buy Any 4 Eligible Products Save $40
    
    Interaction:
    "Copy Code" Functionality: Clicking [Copy Code] must copy the coupon string to the clipboard.
    
    Visual Feedback: Upon a successful copy, change the button text from [Copy Code] to [Copied!] or show a quick success toast notification.
    
    🛒 4. Eligible Products Carousel
    Below the coupon tier cards, please implement the Product Carousel Slider displaying only the following specific items:
    
    Martian 50LB Adjustable Dumbbell
    
    Lava 66LB Adjustable Dumbbell
    
    Adjustable Kettlebell
    
    Dumbbell Stand
    
    Adjustable Weight Bench
    
    Foldable Exercise Bike
    
    Recumbent Exercise Bike
    
    Mobile View for Products: Please use the same responsive setup we discussed previously (showing 1.5 cards peek view on mobile with 12px font size for titles and the automatic xx% OFF discount badges displayed on the top-left corner).
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    font-family: {{ block.settings.font_family.family }}, {{ block.settings.font_family.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.font_family.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.font_family.style }};
  }

  .ai-promo-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-promo-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.title_alignment }};
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .ai-promo-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-promo-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-promo-codes-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .ai-promo-codes-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ai-promo-codes-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-promo-code-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    min-height: 180px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-promo-code-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .ai-promo-code-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .ai-promo-code-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_label_color }};
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-promo-code-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_code_color }};
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .ai-promo-code-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_description_color }};
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-promo-copy-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    font-family: inherit;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-promo-copy-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_background }};
  }

  .ai-promo-copy-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}.copied {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_copied_background }};
  }

  .ai-promo-products-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: 50px;
  }

  .ai-promo-products-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.products_title_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ai-promo-products-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-promo-products-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }

  .ai-promo-products-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-promo-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 calc(25% - 15px);
    background-color: {{ block.settings.product_card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.product_card_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-promo-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .ai-promo-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
  }

  .ai-promo-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-promo-product-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    left: 10px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ai-promo-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .ai-promo-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.product_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-promo-product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: {{ block.settings.product_price_color }};
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ai-promo-product-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #999;
    text-decoration: line-through;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top_mobile }}px 16px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_font_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-promo-codes-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-promo-codes-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
      overflow-x: auto;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      scrollbar-width: none;
      -ms-overflow-style: none;
    }

    .ai-promo-codes-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-promo-codes-mobile-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .ai-promo-codes-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-promo-code-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 85%;
      min-width: 280px;
    }

    .ai-promo-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc(50% - 10px);
      min-width: 150px;
    }

    .ai-promo-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .ai-promo-product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .ai-promo-products-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.products_title_font_size_mobile }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-promo-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-promo-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-promo-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.title != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-promo-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.title }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.subtitle != blank %}
        <p class="ai-promo-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subtitle }}</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-promo-codes-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-promo-codes-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.tier1_enabled %}
